            <ArticleTitle>Sciatica caused by isolated non-Hodgkin's lymphoma of the spinal epidural space: a report of two cases.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>385-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two patients are described in whom sciatica was caused by non-Hodgkin's lymphoma involving the spinal epidural space. Systematic investigation revealed no evidence of lymphoma in other sites.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
